ater reabsorb their reproductive organs once they are old enough to move about on land.","promotion_status":"candidate_only_requires_review"},{"evidence_sha256":"7f88e69b9c40305d16e6b6bc39c14535122b0a500318291bdde392f00eb8b809","evidence_preview":"It can be safely assumed that they are not interfertile with men or mer.","promotion_status":"candidate_only_requires_review"}],"review_status":"first_pass_complete_claims_unpromoted"}